/**
 * quests.js — materials, crafting recipes, drop tables, NPCs, shrines and quests
 *
 * Load order: 2nd. Pure data plus a few lookup tables (MATS, RC, QB, SHB).
 * Coordinates written in quest `visit` objectives and shrines are authored in
 * the original 160x128 map and shifted by (OX,OY) by the loops in this file,
 * so the data stays readable.
 *
 * All files are classic scripts sharing one global scope (no modules); see README.
 */
