/* ---------- quests ---------- */
/* Objectives: kill, bind (filters: sp, zone, aq, elite, minLvl), item (a quest-only drop with the same filters and a chance),
   visit (zone, or x,y within r), sail (n steps afloat), seen / caught (distinct species). A quest with no objectives is a delivery:
   it is ready as soon as it is accepted and is handed in at its turn-in giver. */
